.TH "AtExitHeader" "3type" "2026\-09\-29" "TheCRatTime" "AtExit reference"
.SH NAME
\fBAtExitHeader\fR \- AtExit struct for use AtExit* functions.\&
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fB#include\fR <\fBatexit.\&h\fR>
.PP
.nf
\fBtypedef struct AtExitHeader {
.br
  int         capacity; /* Size of nodes */
.br
  int             left; /* Used nodes    */
.br
  AtExitNode*    array; /* Nodes         */
.br
} AtExitHeader;\fR
.fi
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
This struct need for use AtExit* functions (for example, \fBInitAtExit\fR(3)).\&
.PP
\fBcapacity\fR
.RS 4
Size of nodes.\&
.RE
.PP
\fBleft\fR
.RS 4
Total used nodes.\&
.RE
.PP
\fBarray\fR
.RS 4
Pointer to array with internal struct \fBAtExitNode\fR.\&
.RE
.PP
.SH AUTHORS
Project and man\-page: ThaCRatTime
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBatexit_do\fR(3), \fBInitAtExit\fR(3), \fBDoAtExit\fR(3)
